{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well:\n\n1. **Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n2. **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box.\n3. **Halcyon Sales**: Solid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup.\n\nA quick way to decide: pick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Pipewell if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50ca-702d-87bc-0a269eb383c6","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0122,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:59.500Z","engine":"claude","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["track deals multiple pipelines crm","multiple sales pipelines best practice"],"latency_ms":9330,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[176,189],[512,525]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[284,292],[542,550]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[390,403]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"rela